                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Resource Exploitation"@en .


###  https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#RogueSecuritySoftware
:RogueSecuritySoftware rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                :MalwareType ;
